 ],
 "text": "Your warehouse did $250,000 of work last month. Your invoices only said $242,000. So where did the rest go? Storage that ran past the free period. Special handling the team did on the floor. A kidding job somebody quoted in an email. None of it made the bill. Not because anyone is careless, because nobody is checking the work against the contract. So we built a system that does. Every day it reads what happened in the warehouse, matches it to each client rate, and flags what is missing. Your team approves every line. Then it is built. Want to see what you are missing? Comment Systems, and we will send you the checklist."
